1
00:00:00,952 --> 00:00:02,022
(Howard:)I spend my days

2
00:00:02,020 --> 00:00:03,320
(Howard:)trying to take

3
00:00:03,321 --> 00:00:05,021
(Howard:)ideas and make them real.

4
00:00:05,023 --> 00:00:07,353
(Sheldon:)Well said, old chap.

5
00:00:07,359 --> 00:00:10,059
I thought eloquence had died;
here it stands before us.

6
00:00:10,061 --> 00:00:12,031
Starting today, it'll go:
Gettysburg Address,

7
00:00:12,030 --> 00:00:14,760
"I have a dream"
and what you just said.

8
00:00:14,766 --> 00:00:16,136
(Leonard:)Oh, now he's a genius?

9
00:00:16,134 --> 00:00:18,634
(Leonard:)All you ever do is make fun
of him and engineering.

10
00:00:18,636 --> 00:00:21,676
(Sheldon:)Leonard, please.
His mother just died.

11
00:00:21,673 --> 00:00:23,603
(Leonard:)You're being ridiculous.

12
00:00:23,608 --> 00:00:24,808
(Sheldon:)Yeah, so are you.

13
00:00:24,809 --> 00:00:26,339
(Penny:)Guys, if I wanted to hear
people be bitchy,

14
00:00:26,344 --> 00:00:27,674
(Penny:)I'd go to my real salon.

15
00:00:27,679 --> 00:00:30,449
(Sheldon:)Leonard, lots of people
could've had that idea,

16
00:00:30,448 --> 00:00:31,818
(Sheldon:)but very few people could've

17
00:00:31,816 --> 00:00:33,646
(Sheldon:)worked out the math
the way I did.

18
00:00:33,651 --> 00:00:36,081
(Sheldon:)Lots of people
also didn't have that idea,

19
00:00:36,087 --> 00:00:38,987
(Leonard:)like everyone in the entire
world except for me.

20
00:00:38,990 --> 00:00:40,920
(Sheldon:)Oh, well,
apparently Leonard thinks

21
00:00:40,925 --> 00:00:42,795
(Sheldon:)he's better than everyone
in the whole world,

22
00:00:42,794 --> 00:00:43,894
(Sheldon:)including those

23
00:00:43,895 --> 00:00:45,265
(Sheldon:)fighting for our freedom.

24
00:00:45,263 --> 00:00:46,633
(Howard:)Yeah, well,
I don't know about you,

25
00:00:46,631 --> 00:00:48,331
(Sheldon:)but I support our boys overseas.

26
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:51,500
(Amy:)And girls.

27
00:00:51,503 --> 00:00:54,203
Hey, you already ruined Thor;
give it a rest.

28
00:00:55,439 --> 00:00:56,839
(Leonard:)So I'm just supposed to be okay

29
00:00:56,841 --> 00:00:58,911
(Leonard:)with you hogging
all the credit?!

